<title>USA: Fresh Juice delays filing of annual report.</title>
<headline>Fresh Juice delays filing of annual report.</headline>
<dateline>CLARK, N.J. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Fresh Juice Co Inc on Monday said it was delaying its annual report for the fiscal year ended November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>It said it would file the report on or before March 15.</p>
<p>The delay follows unforeseen financial reporting and accounting difficulties resulting from the consolidation of several business entities acquired during the fiscal year, the company said.</p>
